    },
    {
      "id": "EV2",
      "node_kind": "Event",
      "type": "DiplomaticTalks",
      "label": "US-Iran Negotiation",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "But while ongoing US-Iran negotiations to reach a lasting peace have raised hopes for a return to stability in oil and gas markets, the war has already transformed the global energy landscape in ways that are likely to be long-lasting and even permanent, according to energy experts."
      ],
      "confidence": 1,
      "type_oie": "Negotiation",
      "type_source": "vocab",
      "type_vocab_id": "T0020",
      "type_is_new_to_vocab": true,
      "type_definition": "A discussion between two or more parties to resolve a conflict or reach an agreement",
      "type_parent": "Event",
      "type_justification": "no direct match for negotiation, diplomatic talks is a specific type of event"
    },
    {
      "id": "EV3",
      "node_kind": "Event",
      "type": "HostileAction",
      "label": "Attack on Commercial Vessels",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "Attacks on commercial vessels in the Strait of Hormuz are widely expected to have a chilling effect on shipping lines that persists long after the war is officially brought to an end."
      ],
      "confidence": 1,
      "type_oie": "Attack",
      "type_source": "vocab",
      "type_vocab_id": "T0021",
      "type_is_new_to_vocab": true,
      "type_definition": "An act of aggression or violence",
      "type_parent": "Event",
      "type_justification": "no direct match for attack, hostile action is a specific type of event"
    },
    {
      "id": "CL1",
      "node_kind": "Claim",
      "type": "Statement",
      "label": "Adi Imsirovic's Statement",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "\"The oil market will never be the same, following this conflict,\" Adi Imsirovic, a veteran oil trader who lectures at the University of Oxford, told Al Jazeera."
      ],
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "CL2",
      "node_kind": "Claim",
      "type": "Statement",
      "label": "Dan Marks' Statement",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "\"While the current Iranian regime remains in place and at odds with the United States and Israel, there will always be the possibility that tensions will flare and the strait will close,\" Marks told Al Jazeera."
      ],
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "CL3",
      "node_kind": "Claim",
      "type": "Statement",
      "label": "June Goh's Statement",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "\"For the producers, this would come in the form of more pipeline evacuation routes from the Middle East,\" Goh told Al Jazeera. \"For the buyers, this would mean maintaining a healthy supply of strategic petroleum reserves.\""
      ],
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "CL4",
      "node_kind": "Claim",
      "type": "Statement",
      "label": "Simon Stiell's Statement",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "In April, Simon Stiell, the top United Nations climate official, told a meeting of government officials at the International Energy Agency that the conflict was already \"supercharging the global renewables boom\"."
      ],
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "CL5",
      "node_kind": "Claim",
      "type": "Statement",
      "label": "Mohamed Elheddad's Statement",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "\"The conflict may ultimately bring forward investment decisions that were already in motion,\" Elheddad told Al Jazeera."
      ],
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "CL6",
      "node_kind": "Claim",
      "type": "Statement",
      "label": "Maurice Obstfeld's Statement",
      "is_main": false,
      "evidence": [
        "\"China will benefit, given its dominance in providing renewable energy infrastructure products,\" Obstfeld told Al Jazeera."
      ],
      "confidence": 1
    }
  ],
